  description: "This card's name becomes \"Dark Magician\" while on the field. You
    can only use each of these effects of \"Magician of Dark Illusion\" once per
    turn.\r\n\u25CF During your opponent's turn, if you activate a Spell/Trap Card
    or effect (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon this card from
    your hand.\r\n\u25CF If you activate a Spell/Trap Card or effect while this card
    is face-up on your field (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 \"Dark
    Magician\" in your GY; Special Summon it. This effect can only be used once while
    this card is face-up on the field."
